<title>PHILIPPINES: Abacus B surges on takeover talks.</title>
<headline>Abacus B surges on takeover talks.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abacus Consolidated Resources Inc B shares gained 0.4 centavos, or 23.53 percent, to 2.1 centavos in late Manila trade on Thursday on talks of a company takeover, brokers said.</p>
</text>
